{
  "id": "NUM.18",
  "number": "18",
  "bookId": "NUM",
  "reference": "Ekim. 18",
  "verseCount": 32,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "18",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NUM 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋiticisyo a ŋisacaradotin ka ŋilepi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kirwor Ekapolon neni ka Aron tema, “Ŋiyany daadaŋ ŋulu iyanyere akibois ŋina asegan, eruwor nakou kon ka nakyes a ŋidwe kon a ŋulusapa ta nakyes a ŋituŋa a daadaŋ a ŋulu a ekabila a papa kon; nai iyanyi ŋulu iyanyere asacaradotonu, eruwor nakou kon bon ka nakyes a ŋidwe kon a ŋulusapa bon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, yau daŋ ŋikaitotoi kon ŋulu a ekabila a Lepi, ekabila a papa kon, ikotere ikitiyanakinete iyoŋ apaki ŋina itiyaata iyoŋ kaapei ka ŋidwe kon ŋulusapa alokiŋaren eema ŋolo ka Acamunet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itiyaete ikes ŋiticisyo aŋuna kon ka aŋuna ke eema daadaŋ. Nai nyecamitae ikes etapete ŋiboro ŋulu isitiyao anakibois a ŋina asegan, kori anamuroet, ani ketapa ikes ŋiboro ŋul etwakete kaapei ka iyoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina iyoŋ kitiyata ka ikes ikotere iteete eema ŋolokilipet ka itiyaete ŋiticisyo daadaŋ aloeema, mam ituŋanan ŋinigela ŋini emaikina toapu neni kus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyes ŋikulepek itiyaete ŋiticisyo anakibois a ŋina asegan ka anamuroet ikotere nyeyakaun nabo anyunyura neni a Ŋisirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayoŋ tokona atyaka ŋikaitotoi kon, ŋilepi aneni a Ŋisirael a ŋuluce; erae tokona ikes ŋulu kon ikwapei ainakinet ŋina italeoritae aŋuna ke Ekapolon, ikotere itiyaete ŋiticisyo aloeema a ŋolokilipet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai iyoŋ ka ŋidwe kon ŋulusapa kitiyata ejok ŋiticisyo kus ŋulu ka asacaradotonu alotooma daadaŋ ŋuna iitana anamuroet ka anakibois a ŋina asegan nooi. Akainak ayoŋ iyoŋ asacaradotonu ikwapei ainakinet, ituŋanan ŋinigela daadaŋ ŋini eapuuni nen, emaikina toarae.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋainakineta ŋuna emaikina ŋisacaradotin toryamut",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kirwor Ekapolon neni ka Aron tema, “Akainak ayoŋ iyoŋ apolokin ŋainakineta ŋuna eyaunio neni kaŋ, ŋainakineta a Ŋisirael ŋuna asegak daadaŋ. Adau ayoŋ ainakin ikes neni kon ka neni a ŋidwe kon a ŋulusapa, ikwapei ŋainakineta ŋuna emaikina ŋisacaradotin toryamut, erae ŋuna kus ŋikaru ka ŋikaru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erae ŋainakineta ŋuna asegak nooi ŋuna nyicunyaryo anamuroet nu ŋuna kon: Ŋainakineta daadaŋ ŋuna akainakinete Ŋisirael ayoŋ ikwapei ŋuna asegak nooi, kerae aŋuna a ŋikinyom, ŋainakineta aŋuna ka asecit ka ŋainakineta aŋuna ke ekaile, erae ŋainakineta ŋun ŋuna kon ka ŋuna a ŋidwe kon a ŋulusapa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina iyes kimuja ŋainakineta ŋun erae ŋuna asegak nooi, emaikina erae ŋisapa make enyamete; erae ŋainakineta ŋun ŋuna esegak aneni kus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erae daŋ ŋainakineta nu ŋuna kus: Ŋainakineta daadaŋ ŋuna etyakanaryo anainakineta a Ŋisirael aŋuna ikyaanaryo, akainak ayoŋ iyoŋ kaapei ka ŋidwe kon ŋulusapa ka ŋulupesur ikwapei ainakinet ŋina a ŋikaru ka ŋikaru. Ituŋanan daadaŋ ŋini nyitoroniyaritae alokal kon epedori akinyam ŋainakineta ŋun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akimyet ŋina ajokan daadaŋ, epiini ŋolo ajokan daadaŋ ka ŋikinyom ŋulu ajokak daadaŋ ta ŋainakineta ŋuna ajokak ŋuna einakinete Ŋisirael neni ke Ekapolon, adau ayoŋ ainakin ikes neni kon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋaraito ŋuna esyaunak ŋuna a ŋinyomen a daadaŋ a akwap kec, ŋuna eyaunete ikes neni ke Ekapolon, eruworosi ŋuna kon. Ituŋanan daadaŋ ŋini nyitoroniyaritae alokal kon, epedori akinyam ikes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibore daadaŋ ŋini italeoritae aŋuna kaŋ alo Isirael, erae ŋini kon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikiyae daadaŋ, kerae ŋini a ituŋanan, kori ŋini a etyaŋ, ŋini einakinitae neni a Ekapolon, eruwor ŋin kon, nai emaikina iyoŋ ikilokonyu ikiyae a ituŋanan ka ikiyae a ibarasit a ŋini itoroniyaritae daŋ emaikina iyoŋ ikilokonyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilokonyunio ŋikiyae ŋul eriŋa erae apolou kec elap epei, ilokonyunio ikes a etacit a ŋolo etubunitoe, a ŋolo erae ŋicekelya ŋikan ŋulu ke esilipa, ipimere ecekel a ŋolo ecamunito ŋituŋa daadaŋ isitiyao anakibois a ŋina asegan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai ikiyae ŋini ka ate, kori a amesek, kori a ameot, nyilokonyunio, erae ikes ŋulu asegak. Emaikina iyoŋ towuatak ŋaokot kec namuroet ka kicuny ŋasepwa kec erae ainakinet ŋina epeyo ŋina ebob eure keŋ aneni ka a Ekapolon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nai erae akiriŋ kec ŋina kon, lopite ŋolo eraakar atorobu ka amuro ŋina aloteten a ainakinet a ŋina ikiyanaryo ŋuna kon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋainakineta ŋuna asegak daadaŋ ŋuna einakinete Ŋisirael neni ke Ekapolon, akainak ayoŋ iyoŋ ka ŋidwe kon ŋulusapa ka ŋulupesur, erae ainakinet ŋina emaikina iyes toryamut erae ŋina kus ŋikaru ka ŋikaru. Erae ŋun Acamunet ŋinaruba alokiŋaren Ekapolon, ŋina emaikina iyoŋ ka ŋiletok kon kiwuapa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai Ekapolon tolimok Aron tema, “Nyiyakaunotor iyes ŋalup ŋuna eruworosi ŋuna kus anakwap a Ŋisirael, mam ŋalup ikikorakinio iyes, ayoŋ Ekapolon aruwor ibore ŋini iryamunete iyes ka ŋini eruwor ŋini kus aneni a Ŋisirael.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ainak ayoŋ ŋilepi atutubet apei alotooma ŋitomon a ŋinibore daadaŋ alo Isirael aruwor ŋini kec totacere ikes aŋuna ke etic a ŋolo itiyaete ikes alotooma eema ŋolokilipet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameun tokona, nyecamakinitae Ŋisirael ŋuluce eapiyarete loeema ŋolokilipet, ani kitiyata ikes ŋun, esecete ka etwakete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai ŋilepi ikes itiyaete ŋiticisyo aloeema a ŋolokilipet, asecit daadaŋ ŋina itiyaete ikes a nen, eruwor nakyes kec; eruwor ŋun ŋakiro ŋuna etubunitoe ŋuna emaikina kiwuapae ŋikaru ka ŋikaru. Nai nyeryamunete ŋadilup alo Isirael, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anerae adau ayoŋ ainakin ŋilepi atutubet apei alotooma ŋitomon a ŋiboro a Ŋisirael a ŋulu etyakarete ikes erae ainakinet neni ke Ekapolon. Aŋun, alimu ayoŋ atemar emam ŋalup ekorakinio ikes aneni a Ŋisirael.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai Ekapolon kirwor neni a Moses tema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tolimok ŋilepi ŋakiro nu ebe, ‘Ani ijaunete ikes aneni a Ŋisirael atutubet apei alotooma ŋitomon a ŋiboro kec a ŋulu akainak ayoŋ iyes aneni kec ikwapei ekiner kus, emaikina iyes totyakasi atubet apei alotooma ŋitomon a ŋiboro a ŋul erae ainakinet neni ke Ekapolon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imarakinio ŋun erae ainakinet kus neni kaŋ, ŋina a ŋikinyom a ŋulu eramyo analos ka ŋina a epiini a ŋolo ecuunio anacuet a epiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, iinakinete iyes daŋ ainakinet neni ke Ekapolon alotooma ŋitomon ŋuna ijauni iyoŋ aneni a Ŋisirael, ido iinakini iyoŋ anainakineta a ŋun neni ka Aron a esacaradoti ainakinet neni ke Ekapolon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alotooma ŋainakineta daadaŋ ŋuna ijauni iyoŋ, emaikina iyoŋ totyaka ainakinet ŋina emaikina erae ŋina ke Ekapolon, ainakinet ŋina ajokan nooi alotooma ŋainakineta ŋun iŋes emaikina kitaleoroe.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok daŋ ikes ebe, ‘Ani kidaut iyes atyakar neni ajokan nooi a ŋainakineta a ŋun, idoŋete ŋunace daadaŋ erae ŋuna a ŋilepi, ikwapei ŋikinyom ŋulu eramunio analos ka epiini ŋolo ecuunio anacuet epiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ipedorete iyes akimuj ŋiboro ŋul aneni daadaŋ icamitotor, iyes kaapei ka ŋituŋa a ŋikalya kus, anerae erae eropit kus aŋuna a ŋiticisyo a ŋulu itiyaete iyes aloeema a ŋolokilipet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyikitoroniaryo iyes kitiyata ŋun, anerae iinakis iyes neni ajokan nooi a ŋainakineta a ŋun neni ke Ekapolon. Nyemaikina iyes tomunaasi ŋainakineta a Ŋisirael ŋuna asegak, ani kitiyata iyes ŋun itwakete.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
